                    <h5 class="card-title">Student Portal System</h5>
                    <p class="card-text">A web app for managing student records, grades, and enrollment for a small school.</p>
                    <p class="mb-3">
                        <span class="badge text-bg-light border me-1">C#</span>
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://github.com/KevinRoque1/BSIT31E1_PRELIM_H1_ROQUE_KEVIN_CLERCK"
